    "body": "It doesn't really solve a bug, but it isn't a feature either. It is more like an improvement of the WebIDL code in this spec. By moving the `window` attribute out of the `Window` interface, it becomes clear that `window` isn't part of that interface, but rather is a property of the global object. That the global object happens to be an Window object doesn't matter.",
